{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39719","headline":"江州夜宴献陈员外 · 黄滔","name":"江州夜宴献陈员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"多少欢娱簇眼前，浔阳江上夜开筵。\n数枝红蜡啼香泪，两面青娥拆瑞莲。\n清管彻时斟玉醑，碧筹回处掷金船。\n因知往岁楼中月，占得风流是偶然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39719.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39719","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}